1
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:07,160
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,840
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:16,160
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,440
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,360
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,800
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,360
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,840
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,640
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,600
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,480
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,680
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,680
=Episode 13=

17
00:00:52,119 --> 00:00:56,000
(Cold Palace)
Do you know why you're here?

18
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:58,039
To serve Your Majesty.

19
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:00,920
The Cold Palace

20
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,119
isn't like other places.

21
00:01:02,119 --> 00:01:03,880
I don't need you to pour tea

22
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:05,599
or rub my shoulders and legs.

23
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:06,319
From now on,

24
00:01:06,319 --> 00:01:08,120
you'll work with me in the trial fields.

25
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,280
Farm work?

26
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:11,840
Did I hear that right?

27
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:12,560
Yes.

28
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:13,879
What farm work?

29
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:17,120
If you want to leave, I won't stop you.

30
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:19,519
If you stay, follow my rules.

31
00:01:21,359 --> 00:01:23,760
One, don't stir up trouble.

32
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:25,640
Two, no gossip.

33
00:01:25,959 --> 00:01:28,040
Three, don't bully others.

34
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:30,439
As you command.

35
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:31,040
Good.

36
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,680
Yinshuang, time to eat!

37
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:35,799
Food's ready!

38
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,879
Smells wonderful!

39
00:01:38,879 --> 00:01:39,840
What is this?

40
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:40,319
These...

41
00:01:40,319 --> 00:01:41,560
They're steamed white-flour buns.

42
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,319
Eunuch Cao said

43
00:01:42,319 --> 00:01:44,079
they're made with her miracle wheat.

44
00:01:44,079 --> 00:01:45,920
Even His Majesty rarely gets them.

45
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:46,959
Delicious!

46
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:47,719
Thank you, Your Majesty!

47
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:49,239
I'll work hard!

48
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,359
Keep it up.

49
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:51,599
We may not have much,

50
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,680
but you'll eat your fill.

51
00:01:52,959 --> 00:01:54,439
Her Majesty even pays out of pocket

52
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:55,840
for our summer treats.

53
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:58,000
Chilled sour plum drink at noon,

54
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,560
and seasonal produce in the afternoon.

55
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,400
Thank you, Your Majesty!

56
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,560
Thank you, Your Majesty!

57
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,799
Your Majesty.

58
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:07,079
Quite the entourage.

59
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,199
The Empress Dowager summons you.

60
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,520
Perfect timing, Matron.

61
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,400
Fresh steamed buns.

62
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:12,680
Have one.

63
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:20,840
The Empress Dowager hasn't had any yet.

64
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:21,879
How could I?

65
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:26,680
It's livelier here
than in the Imperial Garden.

66
00:02:29,159 --> 00:02:30,280
Why are you all standing around?

67
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:31,159
Keep eating.

68
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,199
I'll assign your work when I get back.

69
00:02:35,039 --> 00:02:36,599
Lead the way, Matron.

70
00:02:37,639 --> 00:02:38,439
Hmph.

71
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:41,840
Keep eating.

72
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,639
Go on!

73
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:43,840
Delicious.

74
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:51,360
Greetings, Your Majesty.

75
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,280
May you enjoy lasting health.

76
00:02:55,479 --> 00:02:57,240
Kneel before the Empress Dowager!

77
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:02,280
You've grown miracle wheat,

78
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,159
a great service to the realm.

79
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:06,000
I ought to reward you.

80
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,240
Tell me.

81
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,479
What would you like?

82
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,159
I dare not claim credit.

83
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,800
I only wish the people peace

84
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,639
and good health to you and His Majesty.

85
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:23,080
(Did I misjudge her?)

86
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:25,840
(She seemed so easy to control.)

87
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:28,599
(Yet look at the stir she's caused.)

88
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,840
Your Majesty,

89
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:33,120
if you really want to reward me,

90
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,439
could you sell those pretty but useless
ornaments

91
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,719
and give me the cash?

92
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,120
Insolent Lady Lu!

93
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,840
How dare you act up before Her Majesty!

94
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,800
Kneel properly!

95
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,080
I haven't stood up.

96
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:46,599
I'm kneeling, aren't I?

97
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:50,120
The Empress truly is direct.

98
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:53,280
Is the Cold Palace short on money?

99
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:55,319
Not really.

100
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:56,960
I earn enough myself.

101
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,159
No wonder

102
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,240
even the Cold Palace servants

103
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,319
get buns made from miracle wheat.

104
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:06,479
You live better than I do.

105
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:11,680
Did you know that at court yesterday,

106
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:16,079
His Majesty overcame all opposition
to restore you as Empress?

107
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,240
(Yun...)

108
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,639
(Yunluo Pads?)

109
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:23,720
So you hadn't heard.

110
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:36,079
I can help you

111
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,279
secure your place as Empress.

112
00:04:38,639 --> 00:04:41,079
But His Majesty is young.

113
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,879
He sometimes lacks judgment.

114
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:48,639
You'll need to guide him for me.

115
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:53,000
I only know how to farm and run a shop.

116
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,879
I have no such ambition.

117
00:04:55,319 --> 00:04:57,279
Think carefully.

118
00:04:58,279 --> 00:05:00,879
Life in the palace is treacherous.

119
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,600
Be sure you don't take a wrong step.

120
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,920
If there's nothing else, Your Majesty,

121
00:05:12,439 --> 00:05:14,079
I'll take my leave.

122
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,639
A friendly tip.

123
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:22,720
Yunluo Pads aren't for your face.

124
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,639
They're...

125
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,399
period pads.

126
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,839
Is everyone in Ningxin Palace dead?

127
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:42,319
Not one of you thought to tell me?

128
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,800
I didn't dare!

129
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,680
I didn't dare!

130
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,759
Issue my decree.

131
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:53,240
Seal every shop in the Cold Palace.

132
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,040
Anyone who disobeys

133
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,800
shall be executed.

134
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:59,240
Yes, Your Majesty.

135
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,160
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

136
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:05,600
Lady Lu is a different woman now.

137
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:07,079
And now she has His Majesty's favor.

138
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:09,199
If she learns you were behind
the Lu family's downfall...

139
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,439
I gave her a chance.

140
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,920
Delays only invite more trouble.

141
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:19,759
We can't let her become a threat.

142
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,600
(Cold Palace)

143
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:31,720
That wretched old witch!

144
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,480
May her line die out!

145
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,680
May she sleep alone all her days!

146
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,079
Ooh, juicy gossip!

147
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,079
Matron,

148
00:06:38,079 --> 00:06:39,399
tell me everything!

149
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:42,480
My lady, you're too noble

150
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,639
to hear such sordid things.

151
00:06:44,279 --> 00:06:48,120
Please, dear Matron. Tell me!

152
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:55,319
Do you think the Empress Dowager
is His Majesty's birth mother?

153
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,360
In fact,

154
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:59,480
she's Empress Rui's younger sister.

155
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,879
The late Emperor doted on Empress Rui.

156
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,360
When the crown prince was four,

157
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:05,439
Empress Rui became pregnant
with her second child.

158
00:07:05,439 --> 00:07:07,160
She asked the late Emperor

159
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,000
to bring her sister into the palace.

160
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:12,240
But then Empress Rui

161
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,000
died

162
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,439
in childbirth.

163
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:16,759
Then Consort Jin,

164
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:20,439
who closely resembled her sister,

165
00:07:20,759 --> 00:07:23,279
raised the young crown prince herself

166
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:26,360
and eventually became Empress.

167
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,199
Ow, ow, ow!

168
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:31,600
(So that's why she tried to recruit me)

169
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,519
(as her spy beside Ji Wujue.)

170
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:37,000
I've heard an even worse secret.

171
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,360
Don't keep me in suspense.

172
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:39,439
Come on, Matron! Tell me!

173
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,759
Rumor has it

174
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,920
that before entering the palace,

175
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,639
Consort Jin already had a lover

176
00:07:47,199 --> 00:07:49,879
and had an abortion.

177
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:51,199
Oh!

178
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,160
What was that noise?

179
00:07:58,519 --> 00:07:59,480
Don't alarm Her Majesty.

180
00:07:59,759 --> 00:08:00,680
Protect yourselves.

181
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,399
I will.

182
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,879
My lady,

183
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:05,720
a stray cat knocked some tiles loose.

184
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,079
Jia and Yi are chasing it off.

185
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,360
I've been itching for a fight.

186
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,160
Perfect timing.

187
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,519
Wow.

188
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:47,320
That's one big stray cat.

189
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,200
Is this one dead?

190
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:52,559
Unconscious.

191
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:53,720
My brother wanted one alive.

192
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,120
Oh.

193
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,120
Tie him up.

194
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,559
I'll question him myself.

195
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,200
You can interrogate prisoners?

196
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:02,840
I've seen enough to know how.

197
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:21,120
Know which part of a person tastes best?

198
00:09:21,799 --> 00:09:25,559
What wine goes best with human liver?

199
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:28,120
An assassin's blood like yours

200
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,559
with 3 qian of arsenic is perfect.
[*Qian = ancient weight unit]

201
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,360
Want to die?

202
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,519
Not so fast.

203
00:09:35,519 --> 00:09:37,559
It's freshest when taken alive.

204
00:09:38,519 --> 00:09:39,440
Ready?

205
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,399
I'll count to three.

206
00:09:42,879 --> 00:09:45,399
One.

207
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:47,639
Two.

208
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:48,279
Three!

209
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:50,840
Your Majesty.

210
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,240
The meat's ready.

211
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,519
Here.

212
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,039
Look.

213
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,799
Meat from your companion's leg.

214
00:10:04,679 --> 00:10:05,679
Nicely grilled, isn't it?

215
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,279
Ah,

216
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:10,120
the color's a bit off, though.

217
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,559
If you confess,

218
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,519
I'll leave your body intact.

219
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,519
If you don't,

220
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:19,679
I'll feed you your companion's flesh.

221
00:10:20,639 --> 00:10:22,639
Talk!

222
00:10:23,039 --> 00:10:23,919
You witch!

223
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:25,080
Bring another piece.

224
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:27,919
Witch!

225
00:10:27,919 --> 00:10:28,919
Will you talk?

226
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:36,840
(Cold Palace)
Greetings, Your Majesty.

227
00:10:36,879 --> 00:10:37,679
Rise.

228
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,080
Where are they?

229
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,919
In the woodshed.

230
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,919
Her Majesty is questioning him.

231
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,360
What could she possibly get out of him?

232
00:10:45,559 --> 00:10:46,519
He confessed!

233
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,159
I...

234
00:10:50,159 --> 00:10:50,919
Your...

235
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,120
Speak.

236
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,679
What did he confess?

237
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,840
They're assassins from Xiqing.

238
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,559
The one behind it

239
00:10:58,919 --> 00:10:59,759
is the Empress Dowager.

240
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:05,600
Why are you still standing out here?

241
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:08,440
What brings you here, Your Majesty?

242
00:11:13,039 --> 00:11:13,639
Hey!

243
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:14,360
Wait!

244
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:14,799
Hey!

245
00:11:19,639 --> 00:11:20,440
That hurts.

246
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:27,559
Who did this?

247
00:11:29,159 --> 00:11:30,279
You know perfectly well.

248
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:35,120
Give me a little more time.

249
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:37,960
I promise I'll give you an answer.

250
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,320
Which matter, Your Majesty?

251
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:44,720
The Empress Dowager

252
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,279
and the Lu family.

253
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,799
(If only you weren't the Emperor.)

254
00:11:56,639 --> 00:11:57,799
Why look at me like that?

255
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,639
You must be tired, Your Majesty.

256
00:12:11,519 --> 00:12:13,679
Stay for a bite and rest your feet.

257
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:25,879
The skewers are ready!

258
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:29,879
Mind your manners!

259
00:12:29,879 --> 00:12:31,480
Their Majesties haven't eaten yet.

260
00:12:31,679 --> 00:12:32,480
It's fine.

261
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,080
No need for ceremony.

262
00:12:39,279 --> 00:12:40,840
Try this, Your Majesty.

263
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,919
It's my new secret recipe.

264
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:52,039
Is it good?

265
00:12:53,559 --> 00:12:54,720
Have some, Matron.

266
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,200
Thank you.

267
00:12:58,799 --> 00:13:00,320
(In this vast palace,)

268
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,519
(with its countless halls,)

269
00:13:02,799 --> 00:13:04,159
(only this little courtyard)

270
00:13:04,759 --> 00:13:06,279
(feels like home.)

271
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,600
Try this one too, Your Majesty.

272
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:47,440
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

273
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:52,120
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

274
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:56,440
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

275
00:13:56,720 --> 00:14:00,880
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

276
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:05,080
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

277
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:09,480
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

278
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:13,280
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

279
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:18,440
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

280
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:22,240
♪No finery to rival spring♪

281
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:26,720
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

282
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,840
♪Where is beauty found?♪

283
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:35,560
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

284
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,600
